---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Our Story">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink mb-6">Our Story</h1>

    <div class="aspect-video rounded-2xl bg-cream-dark border border-line flex items-center justify-center text-ink-soft text-sm mb-8">
      Maker photo/video goes here
    </div>

    <div class="prose text-ink-soft space-y-4">
      <p>
        <!-- TODO: replace with the real story — maker's name, how long she's been
        crocheting, why she started, what makes each piece take as long as it does. -->
        Stitch &amp; Twirl is a one-woman craft — every piece you see here is made
        by hand, by one person, at home. No factory, no assembly line, no
        shortcuts. A single blanket can take a full week of quiet, careful work.
      </p>
      <p>
        We keep the catalog small on purpose. When a piece is finished, it gets
        listed. When it sells, it's gone — because the next one hasn't been made
        yet. That's not a limitation we're trying to fix; it's the whole point.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
